note The focused symbol as its own root at rank 0 when no node shows it yet. Unless this very node was auto-opened before, its callers and its callees are appended to this frame's expansion list and auto_open is set, so an off-path jump lands in a neighbourhood rather than on a lone box; App::graph_layout then records it with an AutoOpen action and rebuilds, which makes the opening part of the reader's list, so closing either side afterwards sticks.

step yfsnxc
